  "title": "Globe The President Of The Eth Alumni Association On New Networking Prgraommes And Untapped Potential",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "About",
      "text": "Jeannine Pilloud graduated from ETH Zurich with a degree in architecture and went on to pursue a successful career in a number of industries. She came to public attention with her appointment as head of passenger transport at Swiss railway operator SBB. In May 2023, Pilloud was elected president of the ETH Alumni Association on an honorary basis. In July of the same year, she joined the Office of the Vice President for Knowledge Transfer and Corporate Relations, where she is responsible for partnerships with industry and institutions."
    }
